message: >-
  If you use Genesis (formerly Mira Genesis) in software, research, teaching
  or a publication, please cite the project using this metadata. Historical
  papers and frozen experimental records retain the Mira Genesis name under
  which they were published. Historical repository identity:
  https://github.com/mjodheim/mira-genesis
type: software
title: "Genesis"
abstract: >-
  An auditable research program on efficient recursive self-improvement,
  causal learning, evolvable software machinery, cumulative capability
  acquisition and resource-aware successor evaluation.
